# Facts about Grisk.

@fact grisk.lender
tier: surface
text: A goblin moneylender in a velvet waistcoat: sixty crowns today, twelve a month for six months.

@fact grisk.ledger
tier: personal
hint: Pass the time of day with him.
unlock: met(grisk) and seen(grisk_pleasantries) > 0
text: He calls debts "friendships", and keeps all of them in one ledger he never lets out of reach.

@fact grisk.favours
tier: personal
hint: He doesn't always want coin.
unlock: seen(grisk_favour) > 0
text: He sometimes asks for favours instead of coin, and the favours are for clients he never names.

@fact grisk.newt_table
tier: personal
hint: Sit with him at the Newt more than once.
unlock: rel(grisk) >= 4 and seen(grisk_pleasantries) > 0
text: He keeps the corner table at the Gilded Newt, and talks about money the way other people talk about weather: which shops are in trouble, and why.

@fact grisk.collectors
tier: personal
hint: Fall behind on a payment.
unlock: seen(grisk_collectors) > 0 or seen(grisk_troll_letter) > 0
text: When a debt runs late, two trolls in waistcoats come to collect. They are polite, and very thorough.

@fact grisk.parcels
tier: secret
hint: He has work that only happens at midnight.
unlock: seen(grisk_pickup) > 0
text: He runs parcels in oilcloth from the boathouse jetty at midnight to a cobbler's back door in the village. Nobody opens them.

@fact grisk.elixirs
tier: secret
hint: He sells more than loans.
unlock: seen(grisk_elixir_offer) > 0
text: He deals Brightwater and Owl's Ink at the boathouse at midnight, for coin or for favours, and his price climbs before finals and for anyone who can't do without.
